  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "43788610",
      "title": "Outputting Task Data in the Task Component",
      "lectureOrder": 47,
      "videoOrder": 43,
      "sourceHash": "b5f5edadf947eb595d8ce95758d7a210ea3916ffceb39433ed94698079ecc656",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0,
          "end": 2.16,
          "en": "[Maximilian Schwarzmuller] Now that we are able",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.16,
          "end": 5.97,
          "en": "to output the tasks that belong to a user,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.97,
          "end": 9.24,
          "en": "we of course also want to pass that task data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.24,
          "end": 11.43,
          "en": "to that task component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.43,
          "end": 14.79,
          "en": "so that in that task component template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.79,
          "end": 19.2,
          "en": "we output the actual task title and time and so on",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.2,
          "end": 21.96,
          "en": "instead of that dummy data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.96,
          "end": 26.96,
          "en": "And therefore in that task component TypeScript file here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.63,
          "end": 31.11,
          "en": "we of course should accept that data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.11,
          "end": 34.05,
          "en": "that we want to output as input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.05,
          "end": 38.47,
          "en": "Hence, I'll import the input decorator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 39.33,
          "end": 40.953,
          "en": "and then add a new input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 41.85,
          "end": 44.253,
          "en": "And now we have some options.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 45.18,
          "end": 50.18,
          "en": "We could add one input per piece of data we want to output.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 50.73,
          "end": 53.49,
          "en": "So one for the title, one for the time,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 53.49,
          "end": 55.08,
          "en": "and one for the summary.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 55.08,
          "end": 58.53,
          "en": "We could do that, but alternatively",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 58.53,
          "end": 63.53,
          "en": "we could also just accept the entire task object as an input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 64.11,
          "end": 66.93,
          "en": "and then pull out the pieces of data we need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 66.93,
          "end": 69.75,
          "en": "inside of this task component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 69.75,
          "end": 72.24,
          "en": "And that's what I'll do here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 72.24,
          "end": 75.273,
          "en": "So I expect to get a task property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 76.14,
          "end": 80.07300000000001,
          "en": "but of course now we have to define the type of this task.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 81.42,
          "end": 85.8,
          "en": "And that type is the type we in the end define here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 85.8,
          "end": 88.41,
          "en": "in the tasks component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 88.41,
          "end": 91.74,
          "en": "It's this object shape here that we want,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 91.74,
          "end": 95.13,
          "en": "just translated to a type.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 95.13,
          "end": 99.81,
          "en": "So what we can do is go back to the task component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 99.81,
          "end": 103.32,
          "en": "and again, add our own custom object type",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 103.32,
          "end": 107.67,
          "en": "either with the type keyword or with the interface keyword.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 107.67,
          "end": 110.55,
          "en": "I'll name it task here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 110.55,
          "end": 115.08,
          "en": "And then every task should have an ID, a user ID, a title,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 115.08,
          "end": 116.7,
          "en": "a summary, and a due date.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 116.7,
          "end": 118.893,
          "en": "And all the values are strings.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 120.6,
          "end": 124.26,
          "en": "So here it's ID of type string,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 124.26,
          "end": 126.69,
          "en": "user ID of type string,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 126.69,
          "end": 128.493,
          "en": "title of type string,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 129.36,
          "end": 131.73,
          "en": "summary of type string,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 131.73,
          "end": 134.463,
          "en": "and due date of type string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 136.77,
          "end": 139.89,
          "en": "And then we can use this task interface here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 139.89,
          "end": 142.503,
          "en": "as a type for this input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 143.64,
          "end": 146.7,
          "en": "Now we also have to add an exclamation mark",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 146.7,
          "end": 150.36,
          "en": "if we know that we'll always get a task.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 150.36,
          "end": 152.82,
          "en": "And here I do know that this will be the case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 152.82,
          "end": 157.203,
          "en": "because I will also mark this input as required.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 159.36,
          "end": 162.66,
          "en": "With that, we can and have to go back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 162.66,
          "end": 166.14,
          "en": "to the tasks component HTML file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 166.14,
          "end": 170.88,
          "en": "and now bind this newly added task property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 170.88,
          "end": 173.76,
          "en": "to such a task object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 173.76,
          "end": 177.48,
          "en": "And conveniently, that is of course what we're getting here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 177.48,
          "end": 179.13,
          "en": "This task we're getting here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 179.13,
          "end": 183.66,
          "en": "from that selected user tasks list is such a task object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 183.66,
          "end": 187.953,
          "en": "which we then pass as a value for this task property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 188.85,
          "end": 191.61,
          "en": "Now of course, in order to see that task content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 191.61,
          "end": 193.98,
          "en": "on the screen, we then also have to go",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 193.98,
          "end": 196.92000000000002,
          "en": "to the template of the task component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 196.92000000000002,
          "end": 199.59,
          "en": "And instead of outputting task title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 199.59,
          "end": 204.21,
          "en": "as a dummy text like this, we can use string interpolation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 204.21,
          "end": 209.21,
          "en": "to output task.title referring to that task property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 212.04,
          "end": 215.7,
          "en": "we're receiving as an input, which will be of type task,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 215.7,
          "end": 218.583,
          "en": "and which will therefore have a title property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 220.14,
          "end": 222.96,
          "en": "And similarly here we can output",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 222.96,
          "end": 225.723,
          "en": "the task due date.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 227.91,
          "end": 232.083,
          "en": "And here the task summary like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 234.42000000000002,
          "end": 237.15,
          "en": "If you save that, you therefore now should see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 237.15,
          "end": 240.21,
          "en": "the actual task data being output",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 240.21,
          "end": 242.433,
          "en": "for the users that have tasks.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
